{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>蔡天鳳碎屍案｜28歲名媛蔡天鳳（Abby Choi）於2023年2月遇害，前夫鄺港智、前家翁鄺球及前大伯鄺港傑被控謀殺，案件當時進入第28日審訊。庭上閉路電視片段重組她遇害前的行蹤。蔡天鳳案｜鄺球開庭前突改口認阻止合法埋葬屍體罪 原因及背後部署盤算惹熱議</p>\n<p>蔡天鳳碎屍案｜28歲名媛蔡天鳳（Abby Choi）於2023年2月遇害，前夫鄺港智、前家翁鄺球及前大伯鄺港傑被控謀殺，案件當時進入第28日審訊。庭上閉路電視片段重組她遇害前的行蹤。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%89%8d%e5%ae%b6%e7%bf%81%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e8%aa%8d%e7%bd%aa-%e5%9f%8b%e8%91%ac%e5%b1%8d%e9%ab%94-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-2450408/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺球開庭前突改口認阻止合法埋葬屍體罪 原因及背後部署盤算惹熱議</a></p>\n<h2>鄺港傑鄺港智相約練習畫面心寒</h2>\n<p>庭上播放死者蔡天鳳2023年2月21日失蹤當天的閉路電視片段。當日中午時分，鄺港傑駕駛白色七人車接載蔡天鳳前往加多利山單位，其後到旺角新世紀廣場MOKO與鄺港智會面。片段顯示，兩人在星巴克咖啡店交談約1小時，從CCTV看到鄺港傑曾以雙手向下敲打、舉手下劈及模擬套頭扯向自己，胞弟鄺港智則點頭並模仿向下扑的手勢。</p>\n<p>期間，鄺港傑伸出雙手，懸空置於鄺港智頭部上方，隨後模擬將雙手拉向自己，疑似向鄺港智示範並解說、練習動作。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e5%90%88%e7%85%a7-%e5%89%8d%e5%a4%a7%e4%bc%af-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e8%a6%aa%e5%af%86%e6%9c%8b%e5%8f%8b-2450674/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳鄺港傑多張合照庭上曝光 譚方駿首回應二人真實關係 警公開鄺最後接觸蔡衣服</a></p>\n<h2>鄺球案發當日曾購買2張SIM卡</h2>\n<p>庭上資料亦顯示，鄺球案發當日上午曾自行按密碼進入加多利亞山單位，到電訊公司辦理文件並取得合約及兩張SIM卡，其後駕車到大埔龍尾村，期間單位內傳出疑似電鋸聲，約15分鐘後，鄺球到大埔龍尾村的「BB開心棧」午膳，並於下午1時55分步行返回龍尾村的單位。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%89%8d%e5%a4%ab%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e5%90%8d%e9%8c%b6-%e9%90%98%e9%8c%b6%e4%ba%a4%e6%98%93-%e9%99%b3%e4%ba%ae%e6%81%92-damon-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-2447584/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜前妻遇害後 名錶職員揭鄺港智異常舉止 提出1大古怪要求：我照做</a></p>\n<h2>蔡天鳳失蹤日片段曝光 上月因蔡母哭崩求停放影</h2>\n<p>此外，庭上也播放了蔡天鳳失蹤日的閉路電視影片，估計為上月蔡母張燕花觀看到不足半分鐘、痛哭表示「我唔想睇呀」的影片，在聽席上的蔡父也眼泛淚光，當時控方立刻停止播放影片並向她致歉。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e4%b8%88%e5%a4%ab%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e9%83%ad%e8%8e%8e%e6%a8%82-%e4%bc%91%e5%ba%ad-%e5%8a%a0%e5%a4%9a%e5%88%a9%e5%b1%b1%e7%89%a9%e6%a5%ad-%e5%89%8d%e5%ae%b6-2445324/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜蔡天鳳告知真相 譚方駿難過掩面 主控官提出休庭 鄺球於犯人欄疑哭泣</a></p>\n<p>根據片段顯示，蔡天鳳當日下午仍在加多利山單位接待地產經紀及女訪客表示「依度總共有六層」；當訪客問及她的貴婦狗身在何處時，蔡天鳳表示：「我收埋咗佢， 如果唔係佢會好激動」。蔡天鳳逐一介紹樓層、吊燈、沙發及意大利製傢俬，並表示家中「全部啲枱都係意大利，都係靚㗎啦」。</p>\n<p>訪客離開後，蔡天鳳關燈坐在客廳玩手機，相信她正與譚方駿及譚母聯絡。直到下午2時24分離開單位，其後失蹤遇害。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%89%8d%e5%8f%b8%e6%a9%9f-%e9%98%bf%e4%bf%a1-%e9%8c%a2%e7%b4%80%e4%bf%a1-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e8%bb%8acam%e5%af%86%e7%a2%bc-%e5%81%9c%e8%81%b7%e7%95%99%e8%96%aa-2447053/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜前司機阿信離職內幕曝光 庭上揭1處密碼僅鄺港傑知情 揭蔡天鳳躲車內避債主驚險過程</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e6%ad%a4%e6%83%85%e4%b8%8d%e5%86%8d-%e9%90%98%e9%8c%b6%e7%94%9f%e6%84%8f-%e5%a5%b3%e5%85%92%e7%99%bc%e7%87%92-2446053/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜譚方駿稱與鄺港智「此情不再」剖白關係變化內情 1事令關係逆轉：我打咗個突</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e6%be%b3%e9%96%80%e8%b3%ad%e9%8c%a2-500%e8%90%ac%e8%b3%ad%e5%82%b5-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e7%84%a1%e8%a8%bb%e5%86%8a-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-2443847/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜丈夫譚方駿與蔡天鳳無註冊原因 譚家被上門收數 譚父曾向鄺球求助</a></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361177296028305_6854238756ae857fe6c78d.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"蔡天鳳 失蹤日 28歲名媛蔡天鳳（Abby Choi）於2023年2月慘遭碎屍遇害，案件震驚全城。（圖片來源：IG@xxabbyc）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179361177296028305_6854238756ae857fe6c78d.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>28歲名媛蔡天鳳（Abby Choi）於2023年2月慘遭碎屍遇害，案件震驚全城。（圖片來源：IG@xxabbyc）</figcaption></figure>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%be%a4%e5%9d%87-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83%e4%bf%a1%e4%bb%b6-%e8%94%a1%e5%ae%b6%e7%bf%81-%e8%80%81%e7%88%ba-%e4%bb%a3%e4%bb%98%e5%be%8b%e5%b8%ab%e8%b2%bb-2446125/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺球還押寫信求蔡家翁譚澤均 庭上披露信件內容 讀4字時突加重語氣惹熱議</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e5%ad%90%e5%a5%b3-%e5%85%a8%e5%ae%b6%e7%a7%bb%e8%8b%b1-%e7%a7%bb%e6%b0%91%e8%8b%b1%e5%9c%8b-%e9%84%ba%e8%ad%9a%e5%ad%90%e5%a5%b3-%e9%84%ba-2445666/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜譚方駿首披露帶妻及4子女全家移英計劃 蔡天鳳拒鄺譚子女同住原因</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e4%b8%88%e5%a4%ab-%e6%be%b3%e6%b4%b2%e7%95%99%e5%ad%b8-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e7%b9%bc%e5%ad%90%e7%b9%bc%e5%a5%b3-2444979/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜譚方駿出庭作供剖白與蔡天鳳相識經過 揭蔡11字回應鄺港智突失蹤7年</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%a5%b3%e5%85%92%e8%bd%89%e6%a0%a1-%e5%93%88%e7%be%85%e5%9c%8b%e9%9a%9b%e5%ad%b8%e6%a0%a1-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e5%89%8d%e5%a4%a7%e4%bc%af-%e5%8f%b8%e6%a9%9f-2444445/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜女兒因母親離世延遲轉校入學 揭拒前大伯鄺港傑任子女司機真相</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%bc%b5%e7%87%95%e8%8a%b1-%e5%a4%b1%e8%b9%a4-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%83%ad%e8%8e%8e%e6%a8%82-%e5%85%ac%e7%9c%be%e5%b8%ad%e7%ac%91-2442712/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜蔡母問「係咪你捉咗囡囡？」鄺家心寒回應蔡天鳳失蹤 庭內有笑聲 主控郭莎樂神回1句全肅靜</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%8a%a0%e5%a4%9a%e5%88%a9%e5%b1%b1%e8%b1%aa%e5%ae%85-%e8%b1%aa%e5%ae%85-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83%e5%90%8d%e4%b8%8b-%e5%bc%b5%e7%87%95%e8%8a%b1-%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-2442309/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜豪宅登記鄺球名下始末 豪宅出資人並非來自蔡天鳳 蔡母揭女兒收入來源：未婚前已有「億幾兩億」</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ba%ab%e4%b8%96-%e5%ae%b6%e5%ba%ad%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af-%e5%ad%b8%e6%ad%b7-%e5%8a%a0%e5%a4%9a%e5%88%a9%e5%b1%b1%e8%b1%aa%e5%ae%85-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-2440816/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜控方揭蔡天鳳身世學歷背景 買豪宅另有苦衷 母女訊息惹關注 拆解鄺家奪命計劃</a></p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>蔡天鳳命案中主謀一家背景？<i></i></p>\n<p>蔡天鳳好友豹太日前接受《東張西望》訪問時透露，懷疑遇害主因涉及兇手一家居住的加多利山豪宅，更透露兇手一家經常在內地花費的情況驚人⋯⋯<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e6%9d%b1%e5%bc%b5%e8%a5%bf%e6%9c%9b-%e8%b1%b9%e5%a4%aa-plt7-1475077/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">詳情請看</a></b></p>\n<p>蔡天鳳為何聘請前夫兄長做司機？<i></i></p>\n<p>蔡天鳳好友豹太日前接受《東張西望》訪問時透露，Abby大伯是今年農曆年才做Abby司機，而且是因為有人慫恿⋯⋯<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e6%9d%b1%e5%bc%b5%e8%a5%bf%e6%9c%9b-%e8%b1%b9%e5%a4%aa-plt7-1475077/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">詳情請看</a></b></p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T11:20:51.057063+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1678,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T10:00:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T11:18:31.551094+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T11:18:31.551094+00:00","content_hash":"091b3dd67348b6f2df28bd4bd3739a007ae9c5182eb8ff873ab456f310dfe83f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}